(34441,'2019-08-25 09:12:49','2026-04-13 09:59:50','Dominix Quafe Edition','The Dominix is one of the old warhorses dating back to the Gallente-Caldari War. While no longer regarded as the king of the hill, it is by no means obsolete. Its formidable hulk and powerful drone arsenal means that anyone not in the largest and latest battleships will regret ever locking horns with it.',0,250,454500,600,100250000,27,0,50000,1,20982),
(34443,'2019-08-25 09:12:41','2026-04-13 09:59:01','Tristan Quafe Edition','Often nicknamed The Fat Man this nimble little frigate is mainly used by the Federation in escort duties or on short-range patrols. The Tristan has been very popular throughout Gallente space for years because of its versatility. It is rather expensive, but buyers will definitely get their money\'s worth, as the Tristan is one of the more powerful frigates available on the market.',0,29,26500,140,956000,25,0,2500,1,1796),
(34445,'2019-08-25 09:12:44','2026-04-13 09:59:23','Vexor Quafe Edition','The Vexor is a strong combat ship that is also geared to operate in a variety of other roles. The Vexor is especially useful for surveying in potentially hostile sectors as it can stay on duty for a very long time before having to return to base. Furthermore, it is well capable of defending itself against even concentrated attacks.',0,110,115000,480,11100000,26,0,10000,1,20981),
(34457,'2019-08-25 09:12:49','2026-04-13 09:59:51','末日沙场级YC117年特别版','This is a special Armageddon variant developed by a mysterious faction of New Eden.',0,250,486000,600,105200000,27,0,50000,1,20989),
